11. Sri Rama Rao brought to our notice the opinion of this court in R.C. Nos. 1, 2, 3 and 49 of 1975 dated
June 18, 1976 [P. Krishna Rao v. Commissioner of Income-tax
] wherein on identical question a different view was taken by this court.
We are unable to follow that decision for the reason that the earlier opinion in R.C. No. 35/74, decided on 15th December, 1975 (
Additional Commissioner of Income-tax v. T. Nagireddy & Co.
) on identical questions, was not referred to in R.C. No. 1/75 & batch, and also because we are in respectful agreement with the view taken in R.C. No. 35/74.
